Sara Ferreira is an Assistant Professor of Civil Engineering at University of Porto. She is received his Ph.D. in Transportation Safety from University of Porto in 2010. She has approximately twelve years combined teaching, research and technical experience in transportation safety field, with an extensive published quality papers in peer-review journals or conference proceedings.
